<title>USA: Omnicom acquires stake in Organic Online.</title>
<headline>Omnicom acquires stake in Organic Online.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnicom Group Inc said it has acquired a significant minority stake in Organic Online, a World Wide Web-based marketer.</p>
<p>Organic Online has created Web sites for clients such as Colgate-Palmolive Co, Harley-Davidson Inc, Kimberly-Clark Corp, Levi-Strauss, McDonald's Corp, Sony Corp and Lucasfilm, Omnicom said in a statement Friday.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not immediately available.</p>
